      <p class="kicker">ClassicFin Hub modules</p>
      <h1>Finance modules for mobile money agents and multi-branch teams</h1>
      <p>ClassicFin Hub combines subscribed financial operation modules with customer accounts, expenses, reports, analytics, internal notifications and independent review.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="legal-grid reveal">
