      <article class="legal-content">
<h2 id="money-transfer">Money Transfer</h2><p>Record transfer instructions, independently review manual collection, reveal a one-time payout PIN, check receiver details and separately review manual payout. A provider-confirmed remittance is a separate integration.</p>
<h2 id="mobile-money">Mobile Money</h2><p>Support cash-in, cash-out, network float, commissions, agent balancing, receipts, network analytics, and cash drawer impact by branch and operator.</p>
<h2 id="banking">Banking</h2><p>Create customer accounts and independently review funded manual deposits, withdrawals and internal transfers. Posted customer liabilities and funds accounts remain linked to journal evidence. External bank references are instructions, not verified external balances.</p>
<h2 id="forex">Forex</h2><p>Approve branch rates, lock the quote snapshot and independently review manual buy/sell movements. Foreign stock and settlement books remain separate by currency, with journal evidence and cash impact.</p>
<h2>Supporting modules and addons</h2><ul><li>Internal staff notifications and optional email acceptance through a configured delivery worker.</li><li>Filtered reports, read-only operational analytics, CSV exports and browser printing.</li><li>Customer identity records, account liabilities, expenses, fixed staff permissions and independent approvals.</li><li>Separately subscribed inbound Android SMS capture for supported confirmation wording. Manual entry remains available.</li></ul><p>Live provider balances, automated settlement and outbound messaging require separately validated connections. <a href="/product-guide">Read the operating guide</a> for current workflows.</p>
<h2>Plans and pricing</h2><p>Starter Trial, Agent Plan, Finance Plan, and Enterprise Plan can include different module sets, limits, addons, transaction volumes, users, branches, messages, storage, and billing rules. <a href="/pricing">View pricing details</a>.</p>
      </article>
